{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c474aafbbf80669b","name":"Sabertooth-Class Assault/Rescue Vessel","source":{"id":"source:reference-c474aafbbf80669b","title":"Sabertooth-Class Assault/Rescue Vessel","revision":20297,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:35:10Z","sha256":"cd2c26ffaa9526c87bed98ebbf4633cd5d13ebfdf49bdc24d8c1fd68c3229619","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20297","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sabertooth-Class%20Assault/Rescue%20Vessel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c474aafbbf80669b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sabertooth"]},"-Class ship is unique in design and function. It features two long \"teeth\" that extend down from its bow. These teeth are heavily reinforced and adjust to almost any angle. Concealed within are powerful close-range grappling systems, enabling the ship to capture and latch onto enemy vessels or damaged craft. The teeth are strong enough to pierce the hulls of many craft, enabling zero-g assault troops to board captured vessels or quickly deploy rescue teams.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A captured ship is largely helpless in the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sabertooth's"]}," grip. The ship's powerful engines enable it to haul its catch quickly out of the area. Its superstructure is designed to absorb close-range laser fire and survive collisions with little to no damage. As a last resort, if the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sabertooth's"]}," teeth become trapped in a vessel that is in danger of exploding or otherwise harming the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sabertooth"]}," itself, it may use explosive bolts to jettison the teeth in order to make a hasty retreat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Its dual role as an assault ship and rescue vessel require it to carry assault troops, equipment, and weaponry for boarding actions, as well as a full complement of medical and rescue personnel.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Sabertooth"]},"-Class Assault/Rescue Vessel Statistics (CL 17)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 35; +11 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 780; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 100; ",{"tag":"a","childr